    "title": "Bay Transit hiring part-time van driver in New Kent - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Bay Transit is hiring a part-time Van Driver for its New Kent Microtransit service . The position pays $16.00 per hour and is based in New Kent, Virginia . Applicants must have a valid Virginia driver’s license for at least one year, a high school diploma or GED, and be at least twenty-one years old. Three years of driving experience is preferred.\nApplications can be submitted online or at the Bay Transit office at 6901 Terminal Rd, Quinton, VA . A Motor Vehicle Report and resume are required. For more information, call 804-250-2019 ext.1100 or email dcunningham@bayaging.org .\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by Bay Transit (regional public transportation provider)",
